M140 S52 ; set bed temp
M190 S52 ; wait for bed temp
M109 S230 ; wait for extruder temp
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level
G80 X90.0745 Y56.184 W98.5708 H89.8125 ; mesh bed levelling

